        "id": "ch1_5-1",
        "text": "Kali Linux System Management\nSince you will be using Kali Linux as a penetration testing arsenal, then you\nmust know how to handle its system, including how to start an Apache web\nChapter 1 I Mastering the Terminal Window\n35\nserver or check its status. The examples are endless. Don\u2019t worry, we will cover\nthe most common scenarios that you\u2019ll encounter as a penetration tester later.\nFigure 1.14: Kali System Management Commands\n36\nChapter 1 I Mastering the Terminal Window\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Linux Host Information\n\u2022 Linux OS Information\n\u2022 Linux Hardware Information\n\u2022 Managing Running Services\n\u2022 Package Management\n\u2022 Process Management\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
